# Inheritance and field updates in a service-request workflow.
Create a class called ServiceRequest:
    When creating a ServiceRequest with reference and summary:
        Remember reference as this.reference.
        Remember summary as this.summary.
    End constructor.

    To describe:
        Say "Request {this.reference}: {this.summary}.".
    End function.
End class.

Create a class called EscalatedRequest based on ServiceRequest:
    To describe:
        Say "Escalated request {this.reference}: {this.summary}.".
    End function.
End class.

Let request as ServiceRequest be new EscalatedRequest with "SR-2048" and "Investigate delayed nightly reconciliation".
Tell request to describe.
Set request.summary to "Nightly reconciliation delay assigned to the data platform team".
Tell request to describe.
